# Canonical origin. Baked into the build at compile time — there is no server-side
# environment on the host — so it must be correct when you run `npm run build`.
#
# Used for: metadataBase (canonical + og:url + absolute og:image URLs), robots.txt's
# Sitemap line, and the sitemap <loc>.
#
# Leave unset for production: src/content/site.ts already defaults to
# https://legacy-upgrade.com. For development, .env.development already points it at
# https://legacy-upgrade.test. Never put it in .env.local: `next build` loads that file
# too, and the build would ship the local domain.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://legacy-upgrade.com
